  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan annexes three rank eight grotto-heavens together: transformation path Grand Swine grotto-heaven, time path Time Difference grotto-heaven, and rule path Novelty grotto-heaven. The three sit on heaven vein nodes, are rich in resources, and have been taken care of by heaven’s will for many years. He splits them and places their pieces through the sovereign immortal aperture. Novelty grotto-heaven has one super resource point.",
