      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Annexing Grand Swine, Novelty, and Time Difference and refining their heaven path dao marks lets Fang Yuan meet the lowest requirement for refining Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool. Each of those grotto-heavens had merged with a nine heavens fragment. Novelty grotto-heaven contains over one million and six hundred thousand rule path dao marks and over one thousand nine hundred heaven path dao marks.",
